Cooling Observatory is part of Data Center Control Plane (DCCP). It owns
observation, explanation, historical inspection, constraint localisation and
divergence analysis for cooling delivery, and owns no actuator, no topology, no
capacity ledger and no incident state.

Third-party notices
-------------------

This product includes no third-party source code and links no third-party
libraries. It is implemented against the C++20 standard library and the operating
system interfaces it needs for durable atomic file replacement, advisory file
locking and process handling.

The canonical serialization format, the integrity checks (CRC-32C and SHA-256,
FIPS 180-4) and every identity, generation, epoch, revision and ordinal type are
implemented in this repository.

No telemetry is transmitted by this software. It makes no network connections and
sends nothing anywhere.
